# Manage line endings, info from GitHub
# Set default behaviour, in case users don't have core.autocrlf set.
# Always check out LF, also on Windows: the sbt launcher reads .jvmopts and
# githubWorkflowCheck compares the workflow files byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Denote all files that are truly binary and should not be modified.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jar binary
*.dat binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
